  "ruleText": "Int 101.03 \"Deaf person\" means a person whose sense of hearing is nonfunctional for the purpose of communication and whose primary communication is visual.\n\nSource. #7851, eff 3-12-03; ss by #9942, INTERIM, eff 6-18-11, EXPIRED: 12-15-11\n\nNew. #10040-A, eff 12-16-11",
